Z||000004||Black88GT||04-25-2001||10:59 PM||||Just out of curiosities sake, have you guys ever tried changing the oil when the car is hot?  I usually just get my mechanic to do it for me but since I havent had any problems I did it myself this time.  But I let it run for about 5 min., let the exhaust cool, then changed it and it was fine.  I couldn't imagine trying to change it with a hot exhaust, I don't even have a cat. but with a cat. it seemes like it would be more of a pain too (hot one even worse).  I dunno I was just curious...||||reg||1
